― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>It</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوِيق</span> or the like) <i>increased in size</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَبَا</span>) <i>in
the water:</i> (K:) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتبذ</span>. (TA.)

